/*
 * Explicit template solving for TemplateAndExpr.
 *
 * TemplateExplicitAndSolving handles explicit template inference for
 * template parameters that aggregate multiple sub-constraints under a
 * single template variable. A TemplateAndExpr has the form:
 *
 *     T of X0 && X1 && X2, ...
 *
 * where each Xi is a template specification that must individually match the
 * expected type. All constraints must succeed for the template parameter to be
 * considered valid.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::and
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/and.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-13
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
